    "Default is 20 minutes. How often to update and save the statistics.json and to upload last array, when enabled, to Nightscout." : {
      "comment" : "Description for update interval for statistics",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Default is 20 minutes. How often to update and save the statistics.json and to upload last array, when enabled, to Nightscout."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Standard er 20 minutter. Hvor ofte at opdatere og gemme statistik.json og uploade sidste array, når aktiveret, til Nightscout."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Standard ist 20 Minuten. Wie oft die statistics.json aktualisiert und gespeichert werden soll und wie oft das letzte Datenfeld zu Nightscout hochgeladen werden soll, wenn dies aktiviert ist."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Default is 20 minutes. How often to update and save the statistics.json and to upload last array, when enabled, to Nightscout."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Por defecto es de 20 minutos. Con qué frecuencia actualizar y guardar las estadísticas.json y subir la última matriz, cuando está habilitada, a Nightscout."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La valeur par défaut est de 20 minutes. Combien de fois mettre à jour et enregistrer les statistiques.json et télécharger le dernier tableau, une fois activé, sur Nightscout."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Default is 20 minutes. How often to update and save the statistics.json and to upload last array, when enabled, to Nightscout."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il valore predefinito è di 20 minuti. Quante volte aggiornare e salvare le statistiche.json e caricare l'ultimo array, quando abilitato, su Nightscout."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Standard er 20 minutter. Hvor ofte skal skal statistics.json oppdateres og lagres, for deretter å laste opp til Nightscout (hvis aktivert)?"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Standaard 20 minuten. Hoe vaak de statistics.json bijwerken en opslaan en de laatste array, indien ingeschakeld, uploaden naar Nightscout."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Domyślnie jest 20 minut. Jak często aktualizować i zapisywać statistics.json i przesyłać ostatnią tablicę, gdy jest włączona, do Nightscout."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O padrão é 20 minutos. Com que frequência atualizar e salvar as estatísticastics.json e fazer o upload do último array, quando ativado, para o Nightscout."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Standardvärde är 20 minuter. Ange hur ofta du vill uppdatera, spara och ladda upp statistiken till Nightscout."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Default is 20 minutes. How often to update and save the statistics.json and to upload last array, when enabled, to Nightscout."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "За замовчуванням 20 хвилин. Як часто оновлювати та зберігати statistics.json і завантажувати останній масив, якщо ввімкнено, у Nightscout."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mặc định là 20 phút. Tần suất cập nhật và lưu stats.json cũng như tải mảng cuối cùng lên Nightscout khi được bật."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "預設為 20 分鐘。更新和儲存 statistics.json 的頻率以及上傳最後一組資料，當啟用時，至 Nightscout。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Default is false. Any existing temp basals during times the pump was suspended will be deleted and 0 temp basals to negate the profile basal rates during times pump is suspended will be added." : {
      "comment" : "\"Suspend Zeros IOB”",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Default is false. Any existing temp basals during times the pump was suspended will be deleted and 0 temp basals to negate the profile basal rates during times pump is suspended will be added."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Standard er falsk. Alle eksisterende temp basaler i tider, hvor pumpen blev suspenderet, vil blive slettet, og 0 temp basaler til at negere profilen basal hastigheder i tider, pumpen er suspenderet, vil blive tilføjet."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Standard ist aus. Vorhandene temporäre Basalraten während der Zeit, in der die Pumpe angehalten wurde, werden gelöscht und eine temporäre Basalrate von 0 wird hinzugefügt, um die Profilbasalraten während der Zeit, in der die Pumpe angehalten wurde, zu negieren."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Default is false. Any existing temp basals during times the pump was suspended will be deleted and 0 temp basals to negate the profile basal rates during times pump is suspended will be added."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Por defecto es falso. Cualquier basal temporal existente durante las horas de suspensión de la bomba se eliminará y se añadirán basales temporales de 0 unidades para negar las tasas basales del perfil durante las horas de suspensión de la bomba."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La valeur par défaut est desactivé. Tout basal temporaire existant pendant les périodes de suspension de la pompe sera supprimé et basal temporaire à zéro pour annuler le débit de basal du profil lors de la suspension de la pompe sera ajouté."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Default is false. Any existing temp basals during times the pump was suspended will be deleted and 0 temp basals to negate the profile basal rates during times pump is suspended will be added."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il valore predefinito è falso. Eventuali basali temporanee esistenti durante il periodo di sospensione della pompa verranno eliminate e verrà inserita una basale temporanea a zero basali per eliminare le velocità basali del profilo durante il periodo di sospensione della pompa."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Standard slått av. Midlertidig basal som er angitt mens pumpen er deaktivert, vil bli slettet. Midlertidig basal på 0 vil bli lagt til for å jevne ut profilens basalrate mens pumpen er deaktivert."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Standaard uit. Alle reeds ingevoerde tijdelijke basaalstanden die ingevoerd zijn wanneer de pomp is opgeschort, worden verwijderd. Een 0 tijdelijk basaal wordt toegevoegd om de in het profiel opgegeven basaal te overschijven gedurende de tijd dat de pomp was opgeschort."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Domyślnie jest fałszywe. Wszystkie istniejące bazy tymczasowe, podczas gdy pompa została zawieszona, zostaną usunięte i 0 bazy tymczasowe, aby zaniedbać dane bazowe profilu w czasie, gdy pompa jest zawieszona."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Padrão é falso. Qualquer basal temp existente durante os tempos de suspensão da bomba será excluída e 0 basais temporárias para negar as taxas de basal do perfil durante os períodos de suspensão da bomba será adicionado."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Av som standard. Alla eventuella temporära basaler som pågått under tider pumpen varit pausad kommer att raderas, dessutom kommer de ordinarie basaldoserna ersättas med temporära basaler på 0 E/h."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Default is false. Any existing temp basals during times the pump was suspended will be deleted and 0 temp basals to negate the profile basal rates during times pump is suspended will be added."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "За промовчанням false. Будь-які існуючі ТБШ під час зупинки помпи будуть видалені та замінені на нульову ТБШ, щоб прибрати профільні базальні швидкості."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mặc định là False. Mọi mức Temp Basals hiện có trong thời gian máy bơm bị tạm dừng sẽ bị xóa và mức Temp Basals 0 để phủ nhận tốc độ cơ bản của hồ sơ trong thời gian máy bơm bị tạm dừng sẽ được thêm vào."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "預設為 false。在幫浦暫停期間，任何現有的臨時基礎將被刪除，而在幫浦暫停期間為了抵消設定檔基礎速率將新增 0 的臨時基礎。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
