    "For example, at a temp target of %@ %@, your basal is reduced to 50%%, but this scales depending on the target (e.g., 75%% at %@ %@, 60%% at %@ %@)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "For example, at a temp target of %1$@ %2$@, your basal is reduced to 50%%, but this scales depending on the target (e.g., 75%% at %3$@ %4$@, 60%% at %5$@ %6$@)."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For eksempel, ved et temp mål for %1$@ %2$@, din basal reduceres til 50%%, men denne skala afhænger af målet (f. eks. ., 75%% på %3$@ %4$@, 60%% på %5$@ %6$@)."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zum Beispiel an einem temporären Ziel von %1$@ %2$@, Ihr Basal ist auf 50%%reduziert, aber dies skaliert je nach Ziel (e. ., 75%% bei %3$@ %4$@, 60%% bei %5$@ %6$@)."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "For example, at a temp target of %1$@ %2$@, your basal is reduced to 50%%, but this scales depending on the target (e.g., 75%% at %3$@ %4$@, 60%% at %5$@ %6$@)."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Por ejemplo, en un objetivo temporal de %1$@ %2$@, su basal se reduce a 50%%, pero esta escala depende del objetivo (e. ., 75%% en %3$@ %4$@, 60%% en %5$@ %6$@)."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Par exemple, à une cible temporaire de %1$@ %2$@, votre Basal est réduit à 50%%, mais cette échelle dépend de la cible (e. ., 75%% à %3$@ %4$@, 60%% à %5$@ %6$@)."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "For example, at a temp target of %1$@ %2$@, your basal is reduced to 50%%, but this scales depending on the target (e.g., 75%% at %3$@ %4$@, 60%% at %5$@ %6$@)."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ad esempio, ad un obiettivo temporaneo di %1$@ %2$@, la tua basale è ridotta a 50%%, ma questa scala dipende dal bersaglio (e. ., 75%% ad %3$@ %4$@, 60%% ad %5$@ %6$@)."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For eksempel, ved et midlertidig mål på %1$@ %2$@, reduseres basalnivået til 50%%, men dette skaleres avhengig av målet (f.eks. 75%% ved %3$@ %4$@, 60%% ved %5$@ %6$@)."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bijvoorbeeld, op een tijdelijk doel van %1$@ %2$@, je basaal is verlaagd tot 50%%, maar deze weegschaal is afhankelijk van het doel (bijv. ., 75%% op %3$@ %4$@, 60%% bij %5$@ %6$@)."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Na przykład w tymczasowym celu %1$@ %2$@, twoja baza jest zmniejszona do 50%%, ale ta skala zależy od celu (e. ., 75%% o %3$@ %4$@60%% o %5$@ %6$@)."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Por exemplo, em um alvo temporário de %1$@ %2$@, sua basal é reduzida para 50%%, mas esta escala depende do alvo (e. ., 75%% em %3$@ %4$@, 60%% em %5$@ %6$@)."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Till exempel, vid ett temp mål av %1$@ %2$@, reduceras din basal till 50%%, men denna skala beror på målet (i.e., 75%% vid %3$@ %4$@, 60%% vid %5$@ %6$@)."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "For example, at a temp target of %1$@ %2$@, your basal is reduced to 50%%, but this scales depending on the target (e.g., 75%% at %3$@ %4$@, 60%% at %5$@ %6$@)."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "For example, at a temp target of %1$@ %2$@, your basal is reduced to 50%%, but this scales depending on the target (e.g., 75%% at %3$@ %4$@, 60%% at %5$@ %6$@)."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "For example, at a temp target of %1$@ %2$@, your basal is reduced to 50%%, but this scales depending on the target (e.g., 75%% at %3$@ %4$@, 60%% at %5$@ %6$@)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "例如，當臨時目標為 %1$@ %2$@ 時，您的基礎量減少到 50%%，但這會依據目標而改變（例如，75%% 在 %3$@ %4$@，60%% 在 %5$@ %6$@）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For example, if Max COB is 120 g and you enter a meal containing 150 g of carbs, your COB will remain at 120 g until the remaining 30 g have been absorbed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "For example, if Max COB is 120 g and you enter a meal containing 150 g of carbs, your COB will remain at 120 g until the remaining 30 g have been absorbed."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For eksempel, hvis Max COB er 120 g, og du indtaster et måltid indeholdende 150 g kulstof, din COB vil blive ved 120 g, indtil de resterende 30 g er blevet absorberet."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn zum Beispiel Max COB 120 g ist und Sie eine Mahlzeit mit 150 g Kohlendioxid eingeben Ihr COB bleibt bei 120 g bis die restlichen 30 g absorbiert sind."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Por ejemplo, si Max COB es de 120 g e introduce una comida que contiene 150 g de carbonos, su COB permanecerá a 120 g hasta que los 30 g restantes hayan sido absorbidos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Par exemple, si Max COB est de 120 g et que vous entrez un repas contenant 150 g de glucides, votre BEC restera à 120 g jusqu'à ce que les 30 g restants soient absorbés."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "For example, if Max COB is 120 g and you enter a meal containing 150 g of carbs, your COB will remain at 120 g until the remaining 30 g have been absorbed."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ad esempio, se Max COB è 120 g e si entra in un pasto contenente 150 g di carboidrati, il suo COB rimarrà a 120 g fino a quando i restanti 30 g non saranno stati assorbiti."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For eksempel, hvis maks COB er 120 g og du registrerer et måltid som inneholder 150 g karbohydrater, vil COB forbli på 120 g til de resterende 30 g har blitt absorbert."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bijvoorbeeld, als Max COB 120 g is en u een maaltijd opent met 150 g koolhydraten, je COB blijft op 120 g tot de resterende 30 g is geabsorbeerd."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Na przykład, jeśli Max COB wynosi 120 g i wsiada do posiłku zawierającego 150 g węglowodanów, COB pozostanie na poziomie 120 g do czasu wchłonięcia pozostałych 30 g."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Por exemplo, se o Max COB é de 120 g e você entra uma refeição contendo 150 g de carboidratos, a sua COB permanecerá aos 120 g até que os restantes 30 g tenham sido absorvidos."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Till exempel, om Max COB är 120 g och du anger en måltid som innehåller 150 g kolhydrater, kommer din COB att ligga kvar på 120 g tills de överskjutande 30 g har absorberats."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "For example, if Max COB is 120 g and you enter a meal containing 150 g of carbs, your COB will remain at 120 g until the remaining 30 g have been absorbed."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Наприклад, якщо Max COB = 120 g і ви введете страву, що містить 150 г вуглецю, ваш COB буде залишатися на рівні 120 g, доки залишок 30 г не буде поглинуто."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "For example, if Max COB is 120 g and you enter a meal containing 150 g of carbs, your COB will remain at 120 g until the remaining 30 g have been absorbed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "例如，如果最大 COB 為 120 g，而您輸入的餐點含有 150 g 的碳水化合物，您的 COB 會保持在 120 g，直到剩下的 30 g 被吸收。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For most users, leaving this OFF is recommended to ensure consistent basal delivery and loop calculation. If this option is effective, loops will be skipped during the last 5 minutes of the hour." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "For most users, leaving this OFF is recommended to ensure consistent basal delivery and loop calculation. If this option is effective, loops will be skipped during the last 5 minutes of the hour."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For de fleste brugere anbefales det at forlade denne RABAT for at sikre en ensartet beregning af basal levering og løkke. Hvis denne indstilling er effektiv, vil loops blive sprunget over i løbet af de sidste 5 minutter af timen."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Für die meisten Benutzer wird dieser AUS empfohlen, um eine konsistente Basisauslieferung und Schleifenberechnung zu gewährleisten. Wenn diese Option aktiviert ist, werden Schleifen in den letzten 5 Minuten der Stunde übersprungen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para la mayoría de los usuarios, se recomienda dejar este OFF para asegurar la entrega basal y el cálculo del bucle consistente. Si esta opción es efectiva, los bucles se saltarán durante los últimos 5 minutos de la hora."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pour la plupart des utilisateurs, il est recommandé de laisser cette option DÉSACTIVÉE pour assurer un calcul cohérent de la livraison basale et de la boucle. Si cette option est efficace, les boucles seront ignorées au cours des 5 dernières minutes de l'heure."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "For most users, leaving this OFF is recommended to ensure consistent basal delivery and loop calculation. If this option is effective, loops will be skipped during the last 5 minutes of the hour."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Per la maggior parte degli utenti, lasciare questo OFF è consigliato per garantire la consegna basale costante e il calcolo del loop. Se questa opzione è efficace, i cicli saranno saltati durante gli ultimi 5 minuti dell'ora."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For de fleste brukere anbefales det å la denne være AV for å sikre konsekvent beregning av basaltilførsel og looping. Hvis den aktiveres, hoppes det over looper de siste 5 minutterne av hver time."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Voor de meeste gebruikers wordt het verlaten van deze UIT aanbevolen om te zorgen voor consistente basaalstanden en loopberekening. Als deze optie effectief is, worden lussen overgeslagen gedurende de laatste 5 minuten van het uur."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dla większości użytkowników zaleca się pozostawienie tego wyłączenia w celu zapewnienia spójnego obliczania dawki i pętli bazowej. Jeżeli ta opcja jest skuteczna, pętle zostaną pominięte w ciągu ostatnich 5 minut godziny."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para a maioria dos usuários, é recomendado deixar esta opção DESLIGADA para garantir uma entrega e cálculo de ciclo de basal consistentes. Se esta opção for eficaz, os laços serão ignorados nos últimos 5 minutos da hora."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "För de flesta användare, rekommenderas att låta denna inställning vara inaktiverad för att säkerställa en konsekvent basaltillförsel och loopberäkningar. Om detta alternativ är aktivt, kommer loop att hoppas över under de sista 5 minuterna av varje timme."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "For most users, leaving this OFF is recommended to ensure consistent basal delivery and loop calculation. If this option is effective, loops will be skipped during the last 5 minutes of the hour."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Для більшості користувачів, залишаючи цю OFF рекомендується забезпечити постійне доставки та обчислення циклів. Якщо цей параметр ефективний, цикли будуть пропущені протягом останніх 5 хвилин години."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "For most users, leaving this OFF is recommended to ensure consistent basal delivery and loop calculation. If this option is effective, loops will be skipped during the last 5 minutes of the hour."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "對於大部分用戶，建議關閉此選項以確保基礎量交付和循環計算的一致性。如果此選項有效，則在每小時的最後 5 分鐘內將跳過循環。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For simplicity reasons, oref's various forecast curves are displayed as a \"Cone of Uncertainty\" that depicts a possible, forecasted range of future glucose fluctuation based on the current data and the algothim's result." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "For simplicity reasons, oref's various forecast curves are displayed as a \"Cone of Uncertainty\" that depicts a possible, forecasted range of future glucose fluctuation based on the current data and the algothim's result."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Af enkle grunde vises orefs forskellige prognosekurver som en \"Cone of Uncertainty\", der afbilder et muligt forventet interval for fremtidige glukose udsving baseret på de aktuelle data og algothim's resultat."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aus Gründen der Einfachheit werden die verschiedenen Prognosekurven des Orefs als \"Unsicherheit\" dargestellt, das eine mögliche Darstellung darstellt prognostizierter Bereich der zukünftigen Glukosefluktuation basierend auf den aktuellen Daten und dem Ergebnis der algothim."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Por razones de simplicidad, las diversas curvas de previsión del oref se muestran como un \"Cono de la incertidumbre\" que representa un posible, gama preconcebida de fluctuación de glucosa futura basada en los datos actuales y el resultado de la algotina."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pour des raisons de simplicité, les différentes courbes prévisionnelles de Oref sont affichées comme un \"Cône d'incertitude\" qui représente un possible, Plage prévue de fluctuation future du glucose basée sur les données actuelles et le résultat de l'algothim."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "For simplicity reasons, oref's various forecast curves are displayed as a \"Cone of Uncertainty\" that depicts a possible, forecasted range of future glucose fluctuation based on the current data and the algothim's result."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Per motivi di semplicità, le varie curve di previsione dell'oref, vengono visualizzate come un \"Cono di incertezza\" che raffigura un possibile, gamma prevista di fluttuazioni future del glucosio in base ai dati attuali e al risultato dell'algotim."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For enkelhets skyld vises Oref's ulike prognosekurver som en \"usikkerhetskjegle\" som viser et mulig, anslått område for fremtidige blodsukkersvingninger basert på gjeldende data og algoritmens resultat."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Om eenvoudige redenen worden de verschillende voorspellingen van de orefen weergegeven als een \"Cone of Uncertainty\" dat een mogelijk beeld geeft. prognose bereik van toekomstige glucosefluctuatie gebaseerd op de huidige gegevens en het resultaat van algothim."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ze względu na prostotę różne krzywe prognoz oref'a są wyświetlane jako „Cone of certainty”, które przedstawia możliwość, przewidywany zakres przyszłych wahań poziomu glukozy w oparciu o aktualne dane i wyniki algorytmu."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Por razões de simplicidade, as várias curvas previsão do oref são exibidas como um \"Cone de Incerteza\" que retrata um possível, gama prevista de futura flutuação de glicose com base nos dados actuais e no resultado do algothim."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "För att förenkla visas oref's olika prognoskurvor som en samlad  \"Kon av osäkerhet\" som visualiserar ett prognostiserat intervall av framtida glukosfluktuationer baserade på aktuella data och algoritmens beräkningar."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "For simplicity reasons, oref's various forecast curves are displayed as a \"Cone of Uncertainty\" that depicts a possible, forecasted range of future glucose fluctuation based on the current data and the algothim's result."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "З міркувань простоти дослідження різноманітні криві прогнозу відображаються в якості \"Cone з невизначеності\", що дозволяє зобразити це якнайкраще, прогнозоване число коливання глюкози на основі поточних даних та результатів алготиму."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "For simplicity reasons, oref's various forecast curves are displayed as a \"Cone of Uncertainty\" that depicts a possible, forecasted range of future glucose fluctuation based on the current data and the algothim's result."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "為了簡化，oref 的各種預測曲線顯示為一個「不確定性錐」，該錐描繪基於當前資料和算法結果的未來血糖波動的可能預測範圍。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For write data to Apple Health you must give permissions in Settings > Health > Data Access" : {
      "comment" : "Show when have not permissions for writing to Health",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
