    "The Remaining Carbs Cap defines the upper limit for how many carbs the system will assume are absorbing over 4 hours, even when there's no clear sign of absorption from your glucose readings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The Remaining Carbs Cap defines the upper limit for how many carbs the system will assume are absorbing over 4 hours, even when there's no clear sign of absorption from your glucose readings."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De resterende kulhydrater Cap definerer den øvre grænse for, hvor mange kulhydrater systemet vil antage, absorberer over 4 timer, selv når der ikke er noget klart tegn på optagelse fra dine glukoseaflæsninger."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die verbleibende Carbs Cap legt die Obergrenze fest, wie viele Kohlenhydrate das System über 4 Stunden absorbieren wird auch wenn es keine klaren Anzeichen für die Aufnahme aus Ihren Glukose-Messungen gibt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El límite máximo restante de carbohidratos define el límite superior para cuántos glúcidos supondrá que absorberán en más de 4 horas incluso cuando no hay signos claros de absorción de tus lecturas de glucosa."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "La limite de glucides restants définit la limite supérieure pour le nombre de glucides que le système supposera absorber en plus de 4 heures. même s'il n'y a pas de signe clair d'absorption de vos lectures de glucose."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The Remaining Carbs Cap defines the upper limit for how many carbs the system will assume are absorbing over 4 hours, even when there's no clear sign of absorption from your glucose readings."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Il Berretto Carbs Rimanente definisce il limite superiore per il numero di carboidrati che il sistema supporrà assorbire nell'arco di 4 ore, anche quando non c'è un chiaro segno di assorbimento dalle letture di glucosio."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gjenværende karbohydratkap definerer den øvre grensen for hvor mange karbohydrater systemet vil antas å absorberes i løpet av 4 timer, selv om det ikke er klart tegn på absorpsjon fra glukosen din."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "De Resterende Koolhydraten pet definieert de bovengrens voor hoeveel koolhydraten het systeem absorberen meer dan 4 uur. Zelfs als er geen duidelijk teken van absorptie is uit uw glucosemetingen."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pozostała zatyczka węglowodanów definiuje górny limit ilości węglowodanów, które system przyjmuje, pochłaniają przez 4 godziny, nawet jeśli nie ma wyraźnych oznak wchłaniania z odczytów glukozy."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "O limite máximo de carboidratos que restam define a quantidade de hidratos que o sistema irá assumir estão a absorver durante 4 horas. Mesmo quando não há sinais claros de absorção de suas leituras de glicose."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Maxgränsen för återstående kolhydrater definierar hur många kolhydrater systemet kommer att anta absorberas över 4 timmar, även när det inte finns några tydliga tecken på absorption från dina glukosavläsningar."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The Remaining Carbs Cap defines the upper limit for how many carbs the system will assume are absorbing over 4 hours, even when there's no clear sign of absorption from your glucose readings."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Карби, що залишилися - крива визначає верхню межу, кількість автівок буде вважати, поглинається протягом 4 годин, навіть якщо немає чіткої ознаки поглинання з ваших показників глюкози."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The Remaining Carbs Cap defines the upper limit for how many carbs the system will assume are absorbing over 4 hours, even when there's no clear sign of absorption from your glucose readings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "剩餘碳水化合物上限定義系統假設在4小時內吸收的碳水化合物的上限，即使從您的血糖讀取值中沒有明顯的吸收信號。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The settings in this section typically do not require ANY modifications. Do not alter them without a solid understanding of what you are changing and the full impact it will have on the algorithm." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The settings in this section typically do not require ANY modifications. Do not alter them without a solid understanding of what you are changing and the full impact it will have on the algorithm."
