    "This delay accounts for the slower absorption of fat and protein, as calculated by the Warsaw Method, ensuring insulin delivery is properly timed to manage glucose spikes caused by high-fat, high-protein meals." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This delay accounts for the slower absorption of fat and protein, as calculated by the Warsaw Method, ensuring insulin delivery is properly timed to manage glucose spikes caused by high-fat, high-protein meals."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Denne forsinkelse skyldes den langsommere absorption af fedt og protein som beregnet ved Warszawa-metoden. at sikre, at insulinforsyningen er korrekt timet til at styre glukosestikke forårsaget af fedtholdige højproteinmåltider."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese Verzögerung verursacht die langsamere Absorption von Fett und Protein, wie sie nach der Warschauer Methode berechnet wurde, Die Sicherstellung der Insulinlieferung ist zur richtigen Zeit für den Umgang mit Glukosespikes, die durch hochfette, hochproteinreiche Mahlzeiten verursacht werden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este retraso explica la menor absorción de grasas y proteínas, según calcula el método de Varsovia asegurando que la entrega de insulina sea debidamente programada para gestionar los espigas de glucosa causados por comidas de alta grasa y alta proteína."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce retard explique la lenteur de l'absorption des graisses et des protéines, calculée par la méthode de Varsovie, s'assurer que l'insuline est administrée en temps opportun pour gérer les pics de glucose causés par des farines à haute teneur en gras et à haute teneur en protéines."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This delay accounts for the slower absorption of fat and protein, as calculated by the Warsaw Method, ensuring insulin delivery is properly timed to manage glucose spikes caused by high-fat, high-protein meals."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Questo ritardo rappresenta il più lento assorbimento di grassi e proteine, calcolato con il metodo di Varsavia, garantire che la somministrazione di insulina sia programmata in modo appropriato per gestire picchi di glucosio causati da pasti ad alto contenuto di grassi e ad alto contenuto proteico."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Denne forsinkelsen tar hensyn til langsommere absorpsjon av fett og protein, beregnet ved bruk av Warszawa-metoden, for å sikre at insulintilførselen er korrekt tidsavbrutt for å håndtere glukosespygger forårsaket av høyprotein måltider."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deze vertraging is verantwoordelijk voor de tragere absorptie van vet en eiwitten, zoals berekend door de Warschaumethode, ervoor te zorgen dat insuline correct wordt geleverd om glucosepieken te beheren die worden veroorzaakt door hoogvet, eiwithoudende maaltijden."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Opóźnienie to powoduje wolniejsze wchłanianie tłuszczu i białka, obliczone metodą Warszawską, zapewnienie właściwego czasu podawania insuliny, aby opanować kolce glukozy wywoływane przez wysokotłuszczowe, wysokobiałkowe posiłki."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este atraso é responsável por uma absorção mais lenta da gordura e proteína, conforme calculado pelo Método de Varsóvia, Garantir a entrega de insulina é devidamente programado para gerenciar espinhos de glicose causados por refeições altamente gordas, de alta proteína."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Denna fördröjning hanterar den långsammare absorptionen av fett och protein, enligt Warszawa-metoden, och säkerställer insulinleverans vid rätt tidpunkt för att motverka den glukosstigning som orsakas av feta och/eller proteinrika måltider."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This delay accounts for the slower absorption of fat and protein, as calculated by the Warsaw Method, ensuring insulin delivery is properly timed to manage glucose spikes caused by high-fat, high-protein meals."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ця затримка розповідає про повільне поглинання жиру та білка, як це обчислено Варшавськими методами, забезпечення інсуліну доставкою належним чином приурочена до управління шипами глюкози, спричиненими жиром, високим білковим стравом."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This delay accounts for the slower absorption of fat and protein, as calculated by the Warsaw Method, ensuring insulin delivery is properly timed to manage glucose spikes caused by high-fat, high-protein meals."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這項延遲考慮到脂肪和蛋白質的較慢吸收，根據華沙方法計算，以確保胰島素的輸送與高脂肪、高蛋白餐點所引起的血糖高峰的時間恰當。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This determines how many minutes will be between individual Fat-Protein Unit Carb Equivalent (FPU) entries from a single Fat and/or Protein bolus calculator entry." : {
