    },
    "This is an important OpenAPS safety limit. The default setting (which is unlikely to need adjusting) is 3. This means that OpenAPS will never be allowed to set a temporary basal rate that is more than 3x the highest hourly basal rate programmed in a user’s pump, or, if enabled, determined by autotune." : {
      "comment" : "\"Max Daily Safety Multiplier\"",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This is an important OpenAPS safety limit. The default setting (which is unlikely to need adjusting) is 3. This means that OpenAPS will never be allowed to set a temporary basal rate that is more than 3x the highest hourly basal rate programmed in a user’s pump, or, if enabled, determined by autotune."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dette er en vigtig sikkerhedsgrænse for OpenAPS. Standardindstillingen (som sandsynligvis ikke behøver at justere) er 3. Det betyder, at OpenAPS aldrig vil få lov til at indstille en midlertidig basal sats, der er mere end 3x den højeste timeløn basal sats programmeret i en brugers pumpe, eller, hvis aktiveret, bestemmes af autotune."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dies ist ein wichtiges OpenAPS-Sicherheitslimit. Die Standardeinstellung (die wahrscheinlich nicht angepasst werden muss) ist 3. Das bedeutet, dass es OpenAPS niemals erlaubt sein wird, eine temporäre Basalrate festzulegen, die mehr als das dreifache der höchsten Stunden-Basalrate ist, die in der Pumpe eines Benutzers gespeichert ist. Auch bei aktiviertem Autotune gilt diese Grenze."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This is an important OpenAPS safety limit. The default setting (which is unlikely to need adjusting) is 3. This means that OpenAPS will never be allowed to set a temporary basal rate that is more than 3x the highest hourly basal rate programmed in a user’s pump, or, if enabled, determined by autotune."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este es un importante límite de seguridad de OpenAPS. La configuración predeterminada (que es poco probable que necesite ajustarse) es 3. Esto significa que OpenAPS nunca podrá establecer una tasa basal temporal que sea más de 3 veces la tasa basal más alta programada en una bomba de usuario, o, si está activado, determinado por autotune."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ceci est une limite de sécurité importante pour OpenAPS. Le paramètre par défaut ( peu susceptible d'avoir besoin d'être ajusté) est 3. Cela signifie qu’OpenAPS ne sera jamais autorisé à définir un débit basal temporaire supérieur à 3 fois le taux de basal horaire le plus élevé programmé dans la pompe d’un utilisateur, ou, si activé, déterminé par autotune."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This is an important OpenAPS safety limit. The default setting (which is unlikely to need adjusting) is 3. This means that OpenAPS will never be allowed to set a temporary basal rate that is more than 3x the highest hourly basal rate programmed in a user’s pump, or, if enabled, determined by autotune."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Questo è un importante limite di sicurezza di OpenAPS. L'impostazione predefinita (che è improbabile che debba essere modificata) è 3. Ciò significa che a OpenAPS non sarà mai permesso di impostare una velocità basale temporanea superiore a 3x la più alta velocità basale oraria programmata nella pompa di un utente, o, se abilitato, determinato da autotune."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dette er en viktig OpenAPS sikkerhetsbegrensning. Standard innstilling (som neppe trenger justering) er 3. Dette betyr at OpenAPS aldri vil få lov til å sette en midlertidig basalrate som er mer enn 3x den høyeste basalraten i profilen/pumpen, eller, hvis aktivert, basalraten beregnet av autotune."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dit is een belangrijke OpenAPS veiligheidslimiet. De standaardinstelling (die waarschijnlijk geen aanpassingen nodig zal hebben) is 3. Dit betekent dat OpenAPS nooit zal worden toegestaan om een tijdelijke basaalstand in te stellen die groter is dan 3 x de hoogste basaalstand per uur, geprogrammeerd in een gebruikerspomp, of indien ingeschakeld, bepaald door autotune."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jest to ważny limit bezpieczeństwa OpenAPS. Domyślne ustawienie (jest mało prawdopodobne, aby wymagało dostosowania) to 3. Oznacza to, że OpenAPS nigdy nie będzie mógł ustawić tymczasowej dawki bazowej, która jest większa niż 3x najwyższej godzinowej dawki bazowej zaprogramowanej w pompie użytkownika, lub jeśli jest włączona, oznaczona przez autotune."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este é um limite de segurança do OpenAPS importante. A configuração padrão (que não precisa ser ajustada) é 3. Isto significa que o OpenAPS nunca terá permissão para definir uma taxa basal temporária que é mais de 3x a maior taxa basal programada na bomba de um usuário, ou, se habilitado, determinado por autotune."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Detta är en viktig säkerhetsgräns för Trio. Standardinställningen (som sannolikt inte behöver justeras) är 3. Detta innebär att Trio aldrig kommer att tillåtas att ställa in en temporär basaldos som är mer än 3x den högsta basaldosen inställd i pumpen, eller, om aktiverad, den som är inställd av 'Autotune'."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This is an important OpenAPS safety limit. The default setting (which is unlikely to need adjusting) is 3. This means that OpenAPS will never be allowed to set a temporary basal rate that is more than 3x the highest hourly basal rate programmed in a user’s pump, or, if enabled, determined by autotune."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "За замовчуванням (яке навряд чи потрібно змінити) дорівнює 3. Важлива межа безпеки. Це означає, що Тимчасова Базальна Швидкість ніколи не перевищить 3x найбільшої погодинної базальної швидкості, запрограмованої в помпі, або якщо включено, визначається Автотюн."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Đây là giới hạn an toàn quan trọng của OpenAPS. Cài đặt mặc định (có thể không cần điều chỉnh) là 3. Điều này có nghĩa là OpenAPS sẽ không bao giờ được phép đặt tốc độ cơ bản tạm thời cao hơn 3 lần tốc độ cơ bản hàng giờ cao nhất được lập trình trong máy bơm của người dùng hoặc, nếu được bật, sẽ được xác định bằng autotune."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是另一個重要的OpenAPS安全限制。預設設定（不太需要調整）為3。這意味著OpenAPS絕對不允許設定一個臨時基礎率，超過用戶幫浦中設定的最高每小時基礎率的3倍，或者如果啟用了自動調整，則根據其確定的值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This is another important OpenAPS safety limit. The default setting (which is also unlikely to need adjusting) is 4. This means that OpenAPS will never be allowed to set a temporary basal rate that is more than 4x the current hourly basal rate programmed in a user’s pump, or, if enabled, determined by autotune." : {
