    "This peak informs the system when to expect the most potent glucose-lowering effect, helping it predict glucose trends more accurately." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This peak informs the system when to expect the most potent glucose-lowering effect, helping it predict glucose trends more accurately."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Denne top informerer systemet om, hvornår man kan forvente den mest potente glukosesænkende effekt, hvilket hjælper det med at forudsige glukosetendenser mere præcist."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dieser Spitzenwert informiert das System darüber, wann der stärkste Glukoseabsenkungseffekt zu erwarten ist, was dazu beiträgt, die Glukoseentwicklung genauer vorherzusagen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este pico informa al sistema de cuándo esperar el efecto de disminución de glucosa más potente, ayudándolo a predecir las tendencias de la glucosa con mayor precisión."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ce crête informe le système quand il s’attend à ce que l’effet le plus puissant abaisseur de glucose, l’aidant à prédire plus précisément les tendances en matière de glucose."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This peak informs the system when to expect the most potent glucose-lowering effect, helping it predict glucose trends more accurately."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Questo picco informa il sistema quando aspettarsi l'effetto ipoglicemizzante più potente, aiutandolo a prevedere le tendenze del glucosio più accuratamente."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Denne toppgrensen informerer systemet når du skal forvente den mest potente glukosenedsettende effekten, og hjelper det med å forutsi glukosetrenden mer nøyaktig."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Deze piek informeert het systeem wanneer het krachtigste glucose-verlagingeffect kan worden verwacht en het helpt glucosetrends nauwkeuriger te voorspellen."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ten szczyt informuje system, kiedy spodziewać się najsilniejszego działania obniżającego poziom glukozy, pomagając w dokładniejszym przewidywaniu tendencji w zakresie glukozy."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Este pico informa o sistema quando esperar o efeito mais poderoso de redução de glicose, ajudando-o a prever tendências de glicose com maior precisão."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Denna topp informerar systemet när man kan förvänta sig den mest potenta glukossänkande effekten, vilket hjälper algoritmen att förutsäga glukostrenden mer exakt."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This peak informs the system when to expect the most potent glucose-lowering effect, helping it predict glucose trends more accurately."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Цей пік інформує систему, коли очікувати найбільш потужного ефекту глюкози, що допомагає йому передбачити тенденції глюкози більш точно."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This peak informs the system when to expect the most potent glucose-lowering effect, helping it predict glucose trends more accurately."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此峰值通知系統何時預期最強的降血糖效果，幫助更準確地預測血糖趨勢。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This prevents excessive dosing, especially during times of variable insulin sensitivity, enhancing safety." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "This prevents excessive dosing, especially during times of variable insulin sensitivity, enhancing safety."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dette forhindrer overdreven dosering, især i tider med variabel insulinfølsomhed, og øger sikkerheden."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dies verhindert eine übermäßige Dosierung, insbesondere in Zeiten variabler Insulinempfindlichkeit, wodurch die Sicherheit erhöht wird."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esto previene dosis excesivas, especialmente en tiempos de sensibilidad variable a la insulina, mejorando la seguridad."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cela permet d'éviter un dosage excessif, surtout en période de sensibilité à l'insuline variable, améliorant ainsi la sécurité."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
