        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Włącz to ustawienie, aby dostosować dawkę bazową. Zachowaj to ustawienie, jeśli zapotrzebowanie bazowe nie jest bardzo zmienne."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ative esta configuração para dar mais agilidade aos ajustes basais. Continue ativando esta opção se suas necessidades basais não forem altamente variáveis."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aktivera den här inställningen för att ge basaljusteringarna mer dynamik. Behåll den här inställningen avaktiverad om dina basalbehov inte varierar kraftigt."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn this setting on to give basal adjustments more agility. Keep this setting off if your basal needs are not highly variable."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Увімкніть цей параметр, щоб вносити базові корективи більше гнучкості. Продовжуйте це налаштування якщо ваші базові потреби не є дуже мінливими."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turn this setting on to give basal adjustments more agility. Keep this setting off if your basal needs are not highly variable."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "啟用此設定可使基礎調整更加靈活。如果您的基礎需求不是高度變化，則將此設定設為關閉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turning on the Sigmoid Formula setting alters how your Dynamic Ratio, and thus your New ISF and New Carb Ratio, are calculated using a sigmoid curve rather than the default logarithmic function." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turning on the Sigmoid Formula setting alters how your Dynamic Ratio, and thus your New ISF and New Carb Ratio, are calculated using a sigmoid curve rather than the default logarithmic function."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aktivering af indstillingen Sigmoid Formula ændrer hvordan din dynamiske forhold, og dermed din nye ISF og New Carb Ratio, beregnes ved hjælp af en sigmoidkurve i stedet for standardlogaritmisk funktion."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Einschalten der Sigmoid-Formel-Einstellung ändert das Dynamic Ratio und damit das neue ISF und das neue Carb Ratio, werden eher mit einer sigmoid Kurve berechnet als mit der standardmäßigen logarithmischen Funktion."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Activar la configuración de la Fórmula Sigmoid altera la forma en que tu relación dinámica, y por tanto tu nueva relación de ISF y Carbohidratos se calculan utilizando una curva de sigmoid en lugar de la función logarítmica predeterminada."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Activer le paramètre de formule Sigmoid modifie la façon dont votre Ratio Dynamique, et donc votre Nouvelle SI et Nouveau Ratio de glucides, sont calculés en utilisant une courbe sigmoïde plutôt que la fonction logarithmique par défaut."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turning on the Sigmoid Formula setting alters how your Dynamic Ratio, and thus your New ISF and New Carb Ratio, are calculated using a sigmoid curve rather than the default logarithmic function."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Attivando l'impostazione della formula Sigmoid cambia come il tuo rapporto dinamico, e quindi il tuo nuovo rapporto ISF e New Carb, sono calcolati utilizzando una curva sigmoid piuttosto che la funzione logaritmica predefinita."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Slår på Sigmoid Formuleringsinnstillingen endrer hvordan ditt dynamiske forhold, og dermed din nye ISF og New Carb Ratio, beregnes ved hjelp av en sigmoid kurve i stedet for den standard logaritmiske funksjonen."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Het inschakelen van de Sigmoid Formule instelling verandert hoe uw dynamische verhouding en dus uw Nieuwe ISF en Nieuwe Carb Ratio, worden berekend met behulp van een sigmoïd-curve in plaats van de standaard logaritmische functie."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Włączenie ustawienia formuły Sigmoid zmienia jak Twój dynamiczny współczynnik i w ten sposób Twój nowy ISF i nowy współczynnik węglowodanów, są obliczane za pomocą krzywej sigmoidalnej zamiast domyślnej funkcji logarytmicznej."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ativando a configuração da Fórmula de Sigmoid altera a forma como sua Taxa Dinâmica e, assim, sua Nova Proporção de ISF e Nova Taxa de Carbo, são calculados usando uma curva sigmoid em vez da função logarítmica padrão."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Genom att aktivera Sigmoid formel förändras beräkningarna för din dynamiska ratio, och därmed din dynamiska ISF och dynamiska insulinkvot (DR), genom att en sigmoid kurva används istället för den ordinarie logaritmiska funktionen."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turning on the Sigmoid Formula setting alters how your Dynamic Ratio, and thus your New ISF and New Carb Ratio, are calculated using a sigmoid curve rather than the default logarithmic function."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Увімкнення формули сигмоїда змінює спосіб вашого динамічного відношення, і таким чином Нової ОЗП і Нової Карба, обчислюється за допомогою кривої сигмоїда, а не логарифмічної функції за замовчуванням."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turning on the Sigmoid Formula setting alters how your Dynamic Ratio, and thus your New ISF and New Carb Ratio, are calculated using a sigmoid curve rather than the default logarithmic function."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "啟用 Sigmoid 公式設定將改變您的動態比例計算方式，因此您的新 ISF 和新碳水比例將使用 sigmoid 曲線，而非預設的對數函數進行計算。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turning this on will show the grams of carbs needed to prevent a low as a notification badge on the Trio home screen located above the main icon.\n\nOnce enabled, set the Carbs Required Threshold to the lowest number of carbs you'd like to be recommended. A recommendation will not be given if carbs required is below this number.\n\nNote: The carbs suggested with this feature are to be used as a recommendation, not as a requirement. Depending on the current accuracy of your sensor and the accuracy of your settings, the suggested carbs can vary widely. Use your best judgement before injesting the suggested quanitity of carbs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turning this on will show the grams of carbs needed to prevent a low as a notification badge on the Trio home screen located above the main icon.\n\nOnce enabled, set the Carbs Required Threshold to the lowest number of carbs you'd like to be recommended. A recommendation will not be given if carbs required is below this number.\n\nNote: The carbs suggested with this feature are to be used as a recommendation, not as a requirement. Depending on the current accuracy of your sensor and the accuracy of your settings, the suggested carbs can vary widely. Use your best judgement before injesting the suggested quanitity of carbs."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hvis du slår dette til, vises grammet af kulhydrater, der er nødvendige for at forhindre en lav som et meddelelsesmærke på Trio-startskærmen placeret over hovedikonet.\n\nNår aktiveret, indstille kulhydrater kræves Tærskel til det laveste antal kulhydrater, du gerne vil blive anbefalet. Der vil ikke blive givet en anbefaling, hvis kulhydrater er under dette nummer.\n\nBemærk: De kulhydrater, der foreslås med denne funktion, skal bruges som en anbefaling, ikke som et krav. Afhængigt af den aktuelle nøjagtighed af din sensor og nøjagtigheden af dine indstillinger, kan de foreslåede kulhydrater variere meget. Brug din bedste dømmekraft, før du skader den foreslåede modstandsdygtighed over for kulstof."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Das Einschalten zeigt die Gramm der Kohlenhydrate an, die benötigt werden, um einen niedrigen Wert als Benachrichtigungsschild auf dem Trio-Startbildschirm über dem Hauptsymbol zu verhindern.\n\nEinmal aktiviert, setzen Sie den benötigten Carbon-Grenzwert auf die niedrigste Anzahl an Kohlenhydraten, die Sie empfehlen möchten. Es wird keine Empfehlung gegeben, wenn die benötigten Kohlenhydrate unterhalb dieser Zahl liegen.\n\nHinweis: Die mit dieser Funktion vorgeschlagenen Kohlenhydrate sind als Empfehlung und nicht als Anforderung zu verwenden. Abhängig von der aktuellen Genauigkeit Ihres Sensors und der Genauigkeit Ihrer Einstellungen können die vorgeschlagenen Kohlenhydrate sehr unterschiedlich sein. Verwenden Sie Ihr bestes Urteil, bevor Sie die vorgeschlagene Quanitität von Kohlenhydraten verletzen."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turning this on will show the grams of carbs needed to prevent a low as a notification badge on the Trio home screen located above the main icon.\n\nOnce enabled, set the Carbs Required Threshold to the lowest number of carbs you'd like to be recommended. A recommendation will not be given if carbs required is below this number.\n\nNote: The carbs suggested with this feature are to be used as a recommendation, not as a requirement. Depending on the current accuracy of your sensor and the accuracy of your settings, the suggested carbs can vary widely. Use your best judgement before injesting the suggested quanitity of carbs."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Activer cette option affichera les grammes de glucides nécessaires pour éviter un badge de notification faible sur l'écran d'accueil du Trio situé au-dessus de l'icône principale.\n\nUne fois activé, définissez le seuil de glucides requis sur le nombre de glucides le plus bas que vous souhaitez recommander. Une recommandation ne sera pas faite si les glucides requis sont inférieurs à ce nombre.\n\nNote : Les glucides suggérés avec cette fonctionnalité doivent être utilisés comme recommandation, et non comme une exigence. Selon la précision actuelle de votre capteur et la précision de vos paramètres, les glucides suggérés peuvent varier considérablement. Utilisez votre meilleur jugement avant d'injester la quanité suggérée des glucides."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turning this on will show the grams of carbs needed to prevent a low as a notification badge on the Trio home screen located above the main icon.\n\nOnce enabled, set the Carbs Required Threshold to the lowest number of carbs you'd like to be recommended. A recommendation will not be given if carbs required is below this number.\n\nNote: The carbs suggested with this feature are to be used as a recommendation, not as a requirement. Depending on the current accuracy of your sensor and the accuracy of your settings, the suggested carbs can vary widely. Use your best judgement before injesting the suggested quanitity of carbs."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Attivando questa opzione verranno visualizzati i grammi di carboidrati necessari per evitare un abbassamento come distintivo di notifica nella schermata Home del Trio situata sopra l'icona principale.\n\nUna volta abilitata, imposta la soglia richiesta per Carbs al numero più basso di carboidrati che vorresti essere raccomandato. Una raccomandazione non sarà data se i carboidrati richiesti sono al di sotto di questo numero.\n\nNota: i carboidrati suggeriti con questa funzione devono essere utilizzati come raccomandazione, non come requisito. A seconda della precisione attuale del sensore e della precisione delle impostazioni, i carboidrati suggeriti possono variare ampiamente. Utilizzare il vostro giudizio migliore prima di ferire la quanitity suggerita di carboidrati."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ved å aktivere denne funksjonen vil Trio vise antall gram karbohydrater som trengs for å unngå føling. Dette vil vises over hovedikonet på hjemskjermen.\n\nEtter aktivering, sett innstillingen \"Terskel for karbohydratbehov\" til det laveste antall karbohydrater du ønsker å få anbefalt. Det vil ikke bli gitt noen anbefaling dersom behovet er lavere enn det du setter i innstillingen.\n\nMerk: Anbefalingen skal brukes veiledende, ikke som en fasit. Anbefalingen kan variere stort med nøyaktigheten på din sensor og dine innstillinger. Bruk egen vurdering før du inntar karbohydrater i henhold til anbefalingen."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Door dit aan te zetten worden de grammen van koolhydraten weergegeven die nodig zijn om te voorkomen dat een lage als meldingsbadge op het startscherm van de Trio zich boven het hoofdpictogram bevinden.\n\nEenmaal ingeschakeld stel je de vereiste hoeveelheid koolhydraten in op het laagste aantal koolhydraten dat je zou willen aanbevelen. Een aanbeveling wordt niet gegeven als de vereiste koolhydraten onder dit nummer vallen.\n\nOpmerking: de koolhydraten die met deze functie worden voorgesteld, moeten worden gebruikt als een aanbeveling, niet als een vereiste. Afhankelijk van de huidige nauwkeurigheid van de sensor en de nauwkeurigheid van je instellingen, kunnen de voorgestelde koolhydraten sterk variëren. Gebruik je beste beoordeling voordat je de voorgestelde quanitiiteit van koolhydraten beschadigt."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Włączenie tej opcji pokaże gramy węglowodanów potrzebne do uniknięcia niskiej jakości powiadomień na ekranie głównym Trio umieszczonym nad ikoną główną.\n\nPo włączeniu ustaw próg wymaganych węglowodanów na najniższą liczbę węglowodanów, którą chcesz zalecić. Zalecenia nie zostaną podane, jeśli wymagane węglowodany są poniżej tej liczby.\n\nUwaga: węglowodany sugerowane z tą funkcją mają być używane jako rekomendacja, a nie jako wymaganie. W zależności od aktualnej dokładności czujnika i dokładności ustawień, sugerowane węglowodany mogą się znacznie różnić. Przed wstrzyknięciem sugerowanej kwanizacji węglowodanów należy wykonać najlepszą ocenę."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ao ativá-la, você mostrará os gramas de carbs necessários para evitar um sinal de notificação baixo na tela do Trio Home, localizada acima do ícone principal.\n\nUma vez ativado, defina o limite necessário de carboidratos para o menor número de carbos que você gostaria de ser recomendado. Uma recomendação não será dada se os carbs necessários estiverem abaixo deste número.\n\nNota: Os hidratos sugeridos com essa funcionalidade devem ser usados como uma recomendação, não como um requisito. Dependendo da precisão atual do seu sensor e da precisão das suas configurações, os hidratos sugeridos podem variar largamente. Utilize seu melhor julgamento antes de injedificar a quanidade sugerida de carboidratos."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Genom att aktivera denna inställning visas antalet gram kolhydrater som behövs för att förhindra en låg blodsockernivå som en notifieringssymbol på Trio-startskärmen, placerad ovanför hemikonen.\n\nNär funktionen är aktiverad, ställ in “Tröskelvärde för kolhydrater som krävs” till det lägsta antalet kolhydrater du vill få rekommenderat. En rekommendation ges inte om de nödvändiga kolhydraterna understiger detta antal.\n\nObs: De kolhydrater som föreslås med denna funktion är en rekommendation, inte ett krav. Beroende på sensorns aktuella noggrannhet och inställningarnas precision kan de föreslagna kolhydraterna variera kraftigt. Använd ditt omdöme innan du intar den föreslagna mängden kolhydrater."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turning this on will show the grams of carbs needed to prevent a low as a notification badge on the Trio home screen located above the main icon.\n\nOnce enabled, set the Carbs Required Threshold to the lowest number of carbs you'd like to be recommended. A recommendation will not be given if carbs required is below this number.\n\nNote: The carbs suggested with this feature are to be used as a recommendation, not as a requirement. Depending on the current accuracy of your sensor and the accuracy of your settings, the suggested carbs can vary widely. Use your best judgement before injesting the suggested quanitity of carbs."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turning this on will show the grams of carbs needed to prevent a low as a notification badge on the Trio home screen located above the main icon.\n\nOnce enabled, set the Carbs Required Threshold to the lowest number of carbs you'd like to be recommended. A recommendation will not be given if carbs required is below this number.\n\nNote: The carbs suggested with this feature are to be used as a recommendation, not as a requirement. Depending on the current accuracy of your sensor and the accuracy of your settings, the suggested carbs can vary widely. Use your best judgement before injesting the suggested quanitity of carbs."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Turning this on will show the grams of carbs needed to prevent a low as a notification badge on the Trio home screen located above the main icon.\n\nOnce enabled, set the Carbs Required Threshold to the lowest number of carbs you'd like to be recommended. A recommendation will not be given if carbs required is below this number.\n\nNote: The carbs suggested with this feature are to be used as a recommendation, not as a requirement. Depending on the current accuracy of your sensor and the accuracy of your settings, the suggested carbs can vary widely. Use your best judgement before injesting the suggested quanitity of carbs."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "啟用這個功能後，將在 Trio 主畫面上的圖示上方顯示防止低血糖所需的碳水化合物克數作為通知標籤。\n\n啟用後，將碳水所需門檻值設為您希望推薦的碳水化合物的最低數量。如果所需碳水化合物低於此數量，則不會提供推薦。\n\n注意：使用此功能建議的碳水化合物數量僅供參考，並非必需。根據您傳感器的當前準確性和設定的準確性，建議的碳水化合物數量可能會有很大變化。請在攝入建議的碳水化合物數量前谨慎考量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
