    "Use Dynamic CR. The dynamic ratio will be used for CR as follows:\n\n When ratio > 1:  dynCR = (newRatio - 1) / 2 + 1.\nWhen ratio < 1: dynCR = CR/dynCR.\n\nDon't use toghether with a high Insulin Fraction (> 2)" : {
      "comment" : "Enable Dynamic CR",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Use Dynamic CR. The dynamic ratio will be used for CR as follows:\n\n When ratio > 1:  dynCR = (newRatio - 1) / 2 + 1.\nWhen ratio < 1: dynCR = CR/dynCR.\n\nDon't use toghether with a high Insulin Fraction (> 2)"
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Brug Dynamisk CR. Det dynamiske forhold vil blive anvendt til CR som følger:\n\n Når forholdet > 1: dynCR = (newRatio - 1) / 2 + 1.\nNår forholdet < 1: dynCR = CR/dynCR.\n\nBrug ikke med en høj insulinfraktion (> 2)"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nutze Dynamic CR. Das dynamische Verhältnis wird für CR wie folgt verwendet:\n\n Bei Verhältnis > 1: dynCR = (newRatio - 1) / 2 + 1.\nWenn Verhältnis < 1: dynCR = CR/dynCR.\n\nNicht verwenden mit hohem Insulinanteil (> 2)"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use Dynamic CR. The dynamic ratio will be used for CR as follows:\n\n When ratio > 1:  dynCR = (newRatio - 1) / 2 + 1.\nWhen ratio < 1: dynCR = CR/dynCR.\n\nDon't use toghether with a high Insulin Fraction (> 2)"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Usar CR dinámico. La relación dinámica se utilizará para CR de la siguiente manera:\n\n Cuando la relación sea > 1: dynCR = (nueva relación - 1) / 2 + 1.\nCuando la proporción < 1: dynCR = CR/dynCR.\n\nNo use el interruptor con una fracción alta de insulina (> 2)"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Utiliser le CR. dynamique. Le ratio dynamique sera utilisé pour CR comme suit:\n\n Quand ratio > 1: dynCR = (newRatio - 1) / 2 + 1.\nRatio < 1 : dynCR = CR/dynCR.\n\nN'utilisez pas de toghether avec une fraction d'insuline élevée (> 2)"
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Use Dynamic CR. The dynamic ratio will be used for CR as follows:\n\n When ratio > 1:  dynCR = (newRatio - 1) / 2 + 1.\nWhen ratio < 1: dynCR = CR/dynCR.\n\nDon't use toghether with a high Insulin Fraction (> 2)"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Usa CR Dinamico. Il rapporto dinamico sarà utilizzato per CR come segue:\n\n Quando rapporto > 1: dynCR = (newRatio - 1) / 2 + 1.\nQuando il rapporto < 1: dynCR = CR/dynCR.\n\nNon usare insieme a frazione d'insulina elevata (> 2)"
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bruk dynamisk CR. Dynamisk ratio brukes for CR som følger:\n\n Når ratio > 1: dynCR = (newRatio - 1) / 2 + 1.\nNår ratio < 1: dynCR = CR/dynCR.\n\nIkke bruk denne innstillingen sammen med en høy insulinbrøk (Insulin Fraction > 2)"
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gebruik de Dynamische Carb Ratio (CR). De dynamische verhouding wordt als volgt toegepast:\n\n\nAls de verhouding > 1 is: dynCR = (nieuwe verhouding - 1) / 2 + 1.\nAls de verhouding < 1 is: dynCR = CR/dynCR.\nGebruik dit niet samen met een hoge insuline fractie (> 2).\n\n\nEenvoudig gezegd, de Dynamische Carb Ratio past de koolhydraatverhouding aan op basis van je recente verhoudingen. Het zorgt ervoor dat de aanpassingen niet te groot zijn en werkt niet goed als je een hoge insuline fractie hebt."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Użyj dynamicznego CR. Współczynnik dynamiczny będzie stosowany dla CR w następujący sposób:\n\n Gdy stosunek > 1: dynCR = (nowy stosunek - 1) / 2 + 1.\nGdy stosunek < 1: dynCR = CR/dynCR.\n\nNie używaj kostek z wysokim ułamkiem insuliny (> 2)"
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Use CR. Dinâmico A proporção dinâmica será usada para CR da seguinte forma:\n\n When ratio > 1: dynCR = (newRatio - 1) / 2 + 1.\nQuando a proporção < 1: dynCR = CR/dynCR.\n\nNão use toghether com uma fração de Insulina alta (> 2)"
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Använd dynamisk insulinkvot (CR). Den dynamiska kvoten kommer att beräknas som följer::\n\n när kvot  > 1:  dynamisk insulinkvot = (dynamiskISFkvot - 1) / 2 + 1.\nNär kvot < 1: dynamisk insulinkvot = inställd insulinkvot/dynamisk insulinkvot.\n\nUndvik att använda tillsammans med en inställning för \"Kvot av rekommenderad mängd insulin\" över 2"
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Use Dynamic CR. The dynamic ratio will be used for CR as follows:\n\n When ratio > 1:  dynCR = (newRatio - 1) / 2 + 1.\nWhen ratio < 1: dynCR = CR/dynCR.\n\nDon't use toghether with a high Insulin Fraction (> 2)"
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Використовувати Dynamic CR. Dynamic ratio також впливатиме на CR:\n\n Коли ratio > 1: dynCR = (newRatio - 1) / 2 + 1.\nКоли ratio <1: dynCR = CR/dynCR.\n\nНе використовуйте спільно з високим Insulin Fraction (> 2)"
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sử dụng CR động. Tỷ lệ động sẽ được sử dụng cho CR như sau:\n\n Khi tỷ lệ > 1: dynCR = (newRatio - 1) / 2 + 1.\nKhi tỷ lệ < 1: dynCR = CR/dynCR.\n\nKhông sử dụng cùng với Tỷ lệ Insulin cao (> 2)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用動態CR。動態比例將用於CR，如下所示：\n\n當比例>1時：dynCR = (newRatio - 1) / 2 + 1。\n當比例<1時：dynCR = CR/dynCR。\n\n不要與高胰島素比例（>2）同時使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
