    "Uses a combined range of all possible forecasts from the OpenAPS lines and provides you with a range of possible forecasts. This option has shown to reduce confusion and stress around algorithm forecasts by providing a less concerning visual representation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Uses a combined range of all possible forecasts from the OpenAPS lines and provides you with a range of possible forecasts. This option has shown to reduce confusion and stress around algorithm forecasts by providing a less concerning visual representation."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bruger en kombineret vifte af alle mulige prognoser fra OpenAPS linjer og giver dig en række mulige prognoser. Denne mulighed har vist sig at reducere forvirring og stress omkring algoritme prognoser ved at give en mindre om visuel repræsentation."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verwendet eine kombinierte Auswahl aller möglichen Prognosen aus den OpenAPS-Linien und bietet Ihnen eine Reihe von möglichen Prognosen. Diese Option hat gezeigt, dass Verwirrung und Stress rund um Algorithmus-Prognosen durch eine geringere visuelle Darstellung reduziert werden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Utiliza un rango combinado de todas las previsión posibles de las líneas OpenAPS y le proporciona una gama de predisposiciones posibles. Esta opción ha demostrado reducir la confusión y el estrés en torno a los pronósticos del algoritmo proporcionando una menor representación visual."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Utilise une gamme combinée de toutes les prévisions possibles des lignes OpenAPS et vous fournit une gamme de prévisions possibles. Cette option a montré de réduire la confusion et le stress autour des prévisions d'algorithmes en fournissant une représentation visuelle moins importante."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Uses a combined range of all possible forecasts from the OpenAPS lines and provides you with a range of possible forecasts. This option has shown to reduce confusion and stress around algorithm forecasts by providing a less concerning visual representation."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Utilizza una gamma combinata di tutte le possibili previsioni dalle linee OpenAPS e fornisce una serie di possibili previsioni. Questa opzione ha dimostrato di ridurre la confusione e lo stress intorno alle previsioni algoritmiche, fornendo un meno per quanto riguarda la rappresentazione visiva."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bruker en kombinert rekke av alle mulige prognoser fra OpenAPS-linjene og gir deg en rekke mulige prognoser. Dette alternativet har vist seg å redusere forvirring og stress rundt algoritmerprognoser ved å gi en mindre effekt på visuell representasjon."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gebruikt een gecombineerd bereik van alle mogelijke voorspellingen van de OpenAPS-lijnen en biedt u een reeks mogelijke voorspellingen. Deze optie heeft de verwarring en de stress rond de voorspellingen van het algoritme verminderd, door een minder over de visuele representatie te bieden."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Używa łącznego zakresu wszystkich możliwych prognoz z linii OpenAPS i zapewnia szereg możliwych prognoz. Wykazano, że opcja ta zmniejsza dezorientację i nacisk wokół prognoz algorytmu poprzez zmniejszenie liczby reprezentacji wizualnej."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Usa um intervalo combinado de todas as previsões possíveis a partir das linhas do OpenAPS e fornece a você um intervalo de previsões possíveis. Esta opção mostrou-se para reduzir a confusão e o stress em torno de previsões de algoritmos, fornecendo uma representação visual menos relativa."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Använder samtliga underliggande OpenAPS-prognoslinjer och ger dig en samlad helhetsbild. Detta alternativ kan minska förvirring och onödig stress genom att ge en balanserad visuell representation jämfölrt med de mer komplexa individuella prognoslinjerna."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Uses a combined range of all possible forecasts from the OpenAPS lines and provides you with a range of possible forecasts. This option has shown to reduce confusion and stress around algorithm forecasts by providing a less concerning visual representation."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Використовує комбінований спектр всіх можливих прогнозів з OpenAPS ліній і надає вам широкий спектр можливих прогнозів. Цей варіант показаний для зменшення плутанини та стресу навколо алгоритмів прогнозів, забезпечуючи менше стосовно візуального представлення."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Uses a combined range of all possible forecasts from the OpenAPS lines and provides you with a range of possible forecasts. This option has shown to reduce confusion and stress around algorithm forecasts by providing a less concerning visual representation."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用OpenAPS的所有預測的組合範圍，並為您提供可能的預測範圍。這個選項已顯示能減少對算法預測的困惑和壓力，提供了較不擔憂的可視化表示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses the IOB, COB, UAM, and ZT forecast lines from OpenAPS. This option provides a more detailed view of the algorithm's forecast, but may be more confusing for some users." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Uses the IOB, COB, UAM, and ZT forecast lines from OpenAPS. This option provides a more detailed view of the algorithm's forecast, but may be more confusing for some users."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Bruger IOB, COB, UAM, og ZT prognose linjer fra OpenAPS. Denne indstilling giver en mere detaljeret visning af algoritmens prognose, men kan være mere forvirrende for nogle brugere."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Verwendet die IOB, COB, UAM und ZT Vorhersagelinien von OpenAPS. Diese Option bietet eine detailliertere Ansicht der Prognose des Algorithmus, kann aber für einige Benutzer etwas verwirrender sein."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Utiliza las líneas de previsión IOB, COB, UAM y ZT de OpenAPS. Esta opción proporciona una vista más detallada del pronóstico del algoritmo, pero puede ser más confusa para algunos usuarios."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Utilise les lignes IOB, COB, UAM et ZT depuis OpenAPS. Cette option fournit une vue plus détaillée des prévisions de l'algorithme, mais peut être plus confuse pour certains utilisateurs."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Uses the IOB, COB, UAM, and ZT forecast lines from OpenAPS. This option provides a more detailed view of the algorithm's forecast, but may be more confusing for some users."
