    "When \"Fatty Meal\" is selected in the bolus calculator, the recommended bolus will be multiplied by the \"Fatty Meal Bolus Percentage\" as well as the \"Recommended Bolus Percentage\"." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When \"Fatty Meal\" is selected in the bolus calculator, the recommended bolus will be multiplied by the \"Fatty Meal Bolus Percentage\" as well as the \"Recommended Bolus Percentage\"."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Når \"Fedt måltid\" er valgt i bolus lommeregneren, den anbefalede bolus vil blive ganget med \"Fedt Måltid Bolus Procent\" samt den \"Anbefalede Bolus Procent\"."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn \"Fettes Essen\" im Bolzenrechner ausgewählt wird, Der empfohlene Bolus wird mit dem \"Fatty Meal Bolus Prozentsatz\" sowie dem \"Empfohlenen Bolus Prozentsatz\" multipliziert."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cuando se selecciona \"Fatty Meal\" en la calculadora de bolos, el bolo recomendado será multiplicado por el \"Porcentaje de Bolo de Comida Grasa\" así como el \"Porcentaje de Bolo Recomendado\"."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lorsque le « Repas gras » est sélectionné dans la calculatrice de bolus, le bolus recommandé sera multiplié par le « Pourcentage de bolus de repas gras » ainsi que le « Pourcentage de bolus recommandé »."
          }
        },
        "he" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When \"Fatty Meal\" is selected in the bolus calculator, the recommended bolus will be multiplied by the \"Fatty Meal Bolus Percentage\" as well as the \"Recommended Bolus Percentage\"."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quando viene selezionato \"Pasto grasso\" nella calcolatrice in bolo, il bolo raccomandato sarà moltiplicato per la \"percentuale di bolo di pasto grasso\" e per la \"percentuale di bolo consigliato\"."
          }
        },
        "nb-NO" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Når «Fatty måltid» er valgt i boluskalkulatoren. den anbefalte bolusdosen vil bli multiplisert med ”Fatty Meal Bolus Prosent” samt ”Anbefalt bolusprosent”."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wanneer \"Fatty Meal\" is geselecteerd in de bolus calculator, de aanbevolen bolus wordt vermenigvuldigd met de \"Fatty Meal Bolus Percentage\" en de \"Aanbevolen Bolus Percentage\"."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gdy w kalkulatorze bolusa zostanie wybrany \"Mączka tłuszczowa\", zalecany bolus zostanie pomnożony przez „Procent bolusa tłuszczowego” oraz „Procent bolusa zalecanego”."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quando \"Fatty Meal\" for selecionado na calculadora de bolus, o bólus recomendado será multiplicado pela \"Porcentagem Bólus Fatty Meal\", bem como a \"Porcentagem Bólus Recomendado\"."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "När \"Fet måltid\" är markerad i boluskalkylatorn, kommer den rekommenderade bolusen att multipliceras med \"Fet måltid bolusprocent\" samt \"Rekommenderad bolusprocent\"."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When \"Fatty Meal\" is selected in the bolus calculator, the recommended bolus will be multiplied by the \"Fatty Meal Bolus Percentage\" as well as the \"Recommended Bolus Percentage\"."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "При виборі \"Фатті м'яса\" в калькуляторі болта, рекомендований болт буде помножений як \"Жирний Мел Перцента\", так і \"Рекомендований Bolus Percentage\"."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When \"Fatty Meal\" is selected in the bolus calculator, the recommended bolus will be multiplied by the \"Fatty Meal Bolus Percentage\" as well as the \"Recommended Bolus Percentage\"."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "當在注射計算器中選擇「油膩餐」時，推薦的注射量將乘以「油膩餐注射百分比」以及「推薦注射百分比」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When \"Super Bolus\" is selected in the bolus calculator, your current basal rate multiplied by \"Super Bolus Percentage\" will be added to your bolus recommendation." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "bg" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "When \"Super Bolus\" is selected in the bolus calculator, your current basal rate multiplied by \"Super Bolus Percentage\" will be added to your bolus recommendation."
          }
        },
        "da" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Når \"Super Bolus\" er valgt i bolusregnemaskinen, vil din aktuelle basale sats ganget med \"Super Bolus Procent\" blive tilføjet til din bolus anbefaling."
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wenn im Bolusrechner \"Super Bolus\" ausgewählt wird, wird Ihre aktuelle Basalrate multipliziert mit \"Super Bolus Prozent\" zu Ihrer Bolusempfehlung hinzugefügt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
